# The image builds from the workspace's sources and nothing else, so secrets
# (a self-hosting .env), local planning files and build output stay out of the
# build context and its cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!adapters
!ui
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
ui/node_modules
ui/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
# Local secrets inside the allowed directories, as their .gitignore files keep them out of git.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars*
**/.wrangler
**/.cloudflare
